<title>USA: Qualcomm in $42 mln PCS venture with Telex-Chile.</title>
<headline>Qualcomm in $42 mln PCS venture with Telex-Chile.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telex-Chile SA said Tuesday that Chilesat Telfonia Personal SA has been awarded a nation-wide license for personal communication services by Chilean regulators.</p>
<p>The PCS network, said the company, will be formed in conjunction with Qualcomm Inc, which has contributed $42 million for a 50 percent interest in Chilesat.</p>
<p>Qualcomm, said the company, has also signed a $90 million contract to provide network infrastructure and handsets.</p>
</text>
